.Dd October 20, 2026
.Dt CRATE-SNMPD 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm crate-snmpd
.Nd AgentX subagent exposing crate container counters over SNMP
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl f
.Op Fl p Ar socket
.Op Fl i Ar seconds
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is an AgentX
.Pq RFC 2741
subagent.
It connects to the host's SNMP master agent
.Po
.Xr bsnmpd 1
with
.Pa snmp_agentx.so ,
or net-snmp
.Xr snmpd 8
with
.Ic master agentx
.Pc
over a Unix socket, registers the
.Li crate
enterprise subtree
.Pq Li .1.3.6.1.4.1.59999
and answers Get and GetNext requests for it from a cache that a
collector thread refreshes every
.Ar seconds
by running
.Xr jls 8
and
.Xr rctl 8 .
.Pp
The options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl f
Stay in the foreground; do not fork.
.It Fl p Ar socket
Path of the master agent's AgentX socket.
Default
.Pa /var/agentx/master .
.It Fl i Ar seconds
Collector polling interval.
Default 30; 0 is rejected
.Pq it would run Xr jls 8 and Xr rctl 8 in a tight loop .
.El
.Pp
When the master agent closes the connection
.Pq restart, reload
the subagent drops its socket and reconnects with a backoff that
grows from 1 to 30 seconds, re-registering the subtree on success
.Pq since 1.1.50; earlier releases spun at 100 % CPU on the dead descriptor .
.Sh MIB
The MIB module is installed as
.Pa /usr/local/share/snmp/mibs/CRATE-MIB.txt .
The scalars served today are:
.Bl -column ".Li crateContainerRunning.0" ".Li .1.3.6.1.4.1.59999.1.2.0" -offset indent
.It Sy Object Ta Sy OID Ta Sy Meaning
.It Li crateContainerCount.0 Ta Li .1.3.6.1.4.1.59999.1.1.0 Ta number of crate jails seen by Xr jls 8
.It Li crateContainerRunning.0 Ta Li .1.3.6.1.4.1.59999.1.2.0 Ta of which not dying
.It Li crateVersion.0 Ta Li .1.3.6.1.4.1.59999.1.3.0 Ta the crate release
.Pq same number as Xr crate 1 Fl -version
.It Li crateHostname.0 Ta Li .1.3.6.1.4.1.59999.1.4.0 Ta host name
.El
.Pp
.Em Not yet served :
the per-container table
.Li crateContainerTable
.Pq Li .1.3.6.1.4.1.59999.2.1
and the
.Li NOTIFICATION-TYPE
traps that
.Pa CRATE-MIB.txt
also defines.
A Get on a table column answers
.Li noSuchInstance
and no trap is ever sent; use
.Xr crated 8 Ns 's
.Pa /metrics
Prometheus endpoint for per-container figures until the table is
implemented.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "/usr/local/share/snmp/mibs/CRATE-MIB.txt"
.It Pa /var/agentx/master
Default AgentX socket of the master agent.
.It Pa /usr/local/share/snmp/mibs/CRATE-MIB.txt
MIB module
.Pq installed by Ic make install-snmpd .
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
Enable the AgentX master in
.Xr bsnmpd 1
and start the subagent:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
# /etc/snmpd.config
begemotSnmpdModulePath."agentx" = "/usr/lib/snmp_agentx.so"

# /etc/rc.conf
bsnmpd_enable="YES"

service bsnmpd restart
crate-snmpd -i 15
.Ed
.Pp
Query the counters from another host:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
snmpwalk -v2c -c public crate-host .1.3.6.1.4.1.59999
snmpget  -v2c -c public crate-host CRATE-MIB::crateContainerRunning.0
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr bsnmpd 1 ,
.Xr crate 5 ,
.Xr crated 8 ,
.Xr jls 8 ,
.Xr rctl 8
.Rs
.%R RFC 2741
.%T Agent Extensibility (AgentX) Protocol Version 1
.Re
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
agent first appeared in crate version 0.4.0.
